  "notes": "{買|か}い{替|か}える is a compound verb: {買|か}う (to buy) + {替|か}える (to replace/exchange).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {車|くるま}を{買|か}い{替|か}える (to get a new car)\n- パソコンを{買|か}い{替|か}える (to replace one's computer)\n- スマホを{買|か}い{替|か}える (to get a new phone)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {買|か}い{換|か}える: same meaning, sometimes written with this kanji\n- {取|と}り{替|か}える: to exchange/replace (not specifically by buying)\n- {新調|しんちょう}する: to have something made new (more formal)",
